- **true**: yes.', example='false', position='Query'),
  autoStart?: boolean(name='AutoStart', description='Specifies whether to automatically start the task after the purchase is completed. Valid values:
- **false**: no. This is the default value.
- **true**: yes.

> This parameter takes effect only when a valid task ID is specified for the **JobId** parameter and this parameter is set to **true**.', example='false', position='Query'),
  computeUnit?: int32(name='ComputeUnit', description='The specifications of the ETL node. Unit: compute unit (CU). 1 CU equals 1 vCPU and 4 GB of memory. The value must be an integer greater than or equal to 2.
<props="china">
> If you specify this parameter, the [ETL feature](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/212324.html) is enabled to perform data cleaning and transformation.', example='5', minimum=1, maximum=999999, position='Query'),
  databaseCount?: int32(name='DatabaseCount', description='The number of private custom ApsaraDB RDS instances in PolarDB-X. Default value: **1**.
> This parameter is required only when the **SourceEndpointEngineName** parameter is set to **drds**.', example='3', minimum=1, maximum=10000, position='Query'),
  destinationEndpointEngineName?: string(name='DestinationEndpointEngineName', description='The database engine type of the destination instance. Valid values:
- **MySQL**: MySQL database, including ApsaraDB RDS for MySQL and self-managed MySQL databases.
- **PolarDB**: PolarDB for MySQL.
- **polardb_o**: PolarDB O DPI engine.
- **polardb_pg**: PolarDB for PostgreSQL.
- **Redis**: Redis database, including Tair (Redis OSS-Compatible) and self-managed Redis databases.
- **DRDS**: cloud-native distributed database PolarDB-X 1.0 and 2.0.
- **PostgreSQL**: self-managed PostgreSQL database.
- **odps**: MaxCompute.
- **oracle**: self-managed Oracle database.
- **mongodb**: MongoDB database, including ApsaraDB for MongoDB and self-managed MongoDB databases.
- **tidb**: TiDB database.
- **ADS**: cloud-native data warehouse AnalyticDB MySQL 2.0.
- **ADB30**: cloud-native data warehouse AnalyticDB MySQL 3.0.
- **Greenplum**: cloud-native data warehouse AnalyticDB PostgreSQL.
- **MSSQL**: SQL Server database, including ApsaraDB RDS for SQL Server and self-managed SQL Server databases.
- **kafka**: Kafka database, including MSMQ Kafka Edition and self-managed Kafka clusters.
- **DataHub**: DataHub.
- **DB2**: self-managed Db2 for LUW database.
